WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.403
- It is a kid's show, right?

00:00:02.270 --> 00:00:03.283
- Well...

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:11.740
- We're going to be watching

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:14.800
The Chilling Adventures of Sabrina.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:17.200
Sabrina is a half-human, half-witch.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:18.900
You know, we used to burn witches.

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:20.793
- Yeah, we did.

00:00:20.793 --> 00:00:22.580
- I'm like, what's this about?

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:24.730
- I read about her in the comics.

00:00:24.730 --> 00:00:25.563
- When were they out?

00:00:25.563 --> 00:00:26.396
- The Dark ages.

00:00:26.396 --> 00:00:27.427
- Excuse me.

00:00:29.926 --> 00:00:30.759
- Ambrose!

00:00:32.090 --> 00:00:33.730
Can anyone explain why it looks like

00:00:33.730 --> 00:00:37.010
the Texas Chainsaw Massacre
has been nailed to our door?

00:00:37.010 --> 00:00:39.280
- It means our family's
been selected to participate

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:41.330
in this year's Feast of Feasts.

00:00:41.330 --> 00:00:42.730
- So, the celebration of the Feast

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:45.690
is a celebration of cannibalism.

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:46.710
- If you change a few of the words,

00:00:46.710 --> 00:00:48.220
it almost sounds like church last night.

00:00:48.220 --> 00:00:51.490
- Tonight we celebrate a
time-honored tradition,

00:00:51.490 --> 00:00:53.940
the Feast of Feasts.

00:00:53.940 --> 00:00:56.040
- No, I think they're
actually gonna have a lottery

00:00:56.040 --> 00:00:58.910
and whoever wins it is
the person who dies.

00:00:58.910 --> 00:00:59.960
- And then they eat that person.

00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:01.500
- And then they eat that person.

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:03.790
- The Lord's Supper is sort
of cannibalistic, isn't it?

00:01:03.790 --> 00:01:06.270
Like, we eat the body of
Jesus Christ, interesting.

00:01:06.270 --> 00:01:07.103
- Drink his blood.

00:01:07.103 --> 00:01:08.137
- Yeah.

00:01:08.137 --> 00:01:10.661
- Prudence is queen.

00:01:10.661 --> 00:01:12.447
- And they think this is a great honor.

00:01:13.280 --> 00:01:14.703
- It's religious diversity.

00:01:18.030 --> 00:01:18.863
- Darling, can I have a warm

00:01:18.863 --> 00:01:20.830
buttermilk bath tonight, please?

00:01:20.830 --> 00:01:23.863
- I can't think of anything
worse than a buttermilk bath.

00:01:24.696 --> 00:01:26.000
- Uh, I--

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:27.990
- You're killing the mood, Shepard.

00:01:27.990 --> 00:01:30.146
- You're killing the mood.

00:01:30.146 --> 00:01:31.260
- Great.

00:01:31.260 --> 00:01:33.713
- Either get in or get out.

00:01:34.990 --> 00:01:35.883
- Awkward.

00:01:36.850 --> 00:01:37.930
- If you're a witch it's all--

00:01:37.930 --> 00:01:38.763
- Sure.

00:01:38.763 --> 00:01:39.777
- Very holy.

00:01:40.610 --> 00:01:41.443
- It's a bit dark there.

00:01:41.443 --> 00:01:42.640
- Yeah, that's right, we can't really see.

00:01:42.640 --> 00:01:45.930
- It's like the exact
negative, reverse, opposite

00:01:45.930 --> 00:01:48.330
of all of traditional Christian values.

00:01:48.330 --> 00:01:51.271
- So, they just inverted it all, right.

00:01:54.020 --> 00:01:55.133
What is that?

00:01:55.966 --> 00:01:57.960
- Form a pentagram around the creature.

00:01:57.960 --> 00:01:59.901
- Wait, Ms. Wardwell, what are we doing?

00:02:00.734 --> 00:02:02.450
- Pulling the wool over their eyes.

00:02:02.450 --> 00:02:03.957
- That's pretty cool.

00:02:03.957 --> 00:02:08.400
The Dark Lord shall behold 

00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:09.479
- Praise Satan!

00:02:15.383 --> 00:02:16.880
- I'm not a fan of this.

00:02:16.880 --> 00:02:19.000
- Isn't your church like this?

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:20.380
Although, I'm getting some ideas.

00:02:23.980 --> 00:02:24.927
- What?

00:02:24.927 --> 00:02:25.830
- What?

00:02:25.830 --> 00:02:26.663
- Uggggh.

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:30.930
- Do they have to give
her some sort of spices

00:02:30.930 --> 00:02:33.313
or anything like that to
make her a bit more tasty?

00:02:34.429 --> 00:02:35.262
- Ugh.

00:02:42.370 --> 00:02:44.156
- I shouldn't laugh at that.

00:02:49.460 --> 00:02:51.250
- Let sticks and stones break

00:02:51.250 --> 00:02:53.103
the witch hunter's bones.

00:02:55.070 --> 00:02:57.350
- I won't be watching Sabrina again.

00:02:57.350 --> 00:02:59.040
- I really enjoy Sabrina.

00:02:59.040 --> 00:03:01.150
- I thought Sabrina was
really well produced

00:03:01.150 --> 00:03:03.560
and I thought it asks
some profound questions

00:03:03.560 --> 00:03:04.800
about what it is to believe.

00:03:04.800 --> 00:03:06.860
- I would highly recommend it.

00:03:06.860 --> 00:03:08.130
I think sometimes it's important

00:03:08.130 --> 00:03:10.960
to go outside of your
faith to actually really

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:12.400
understand what it is you believe.

00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:14.130
- I think in some ways it is a parody

00:03:14.130 --> 00:03:15.500
of traditional Christianity,

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:18.000
so I can appreciate some of the points

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:19.010
it was trying to make.

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:22.691
I would have preferred a
little bit less cannibalism.

00:03:27.130 --> 00:03:29.710
I gotta go home and try one
of those buttermilk baths.

00:03:29.710 --> 00:03:30.590
- Seriously?

00:03:30.590 --> 00:03:31.552
- No.

